bagian hasil tanaman dan hewan (bagian) untuk Allah sambil berkata menurut persangkaan mereka, \"Ini untuk Allah dan yang ini untuk berhala-berhala kami.\" Bagian yang untuk berhala-berhala mereka tidak akan sampai kepada Allah, dan bagian yang untuk Allah akan sampai kepada berhala-berhala mereka.<sup foot_note=135276>1</sup> Sangat buruk ketetapan mereka itu."},{"resource_id":999,"language_name":"gorontalo","text":"Wau timongolio ma lopopodu-lunga'o to Allah ngotayadee tuwau mondo pilomulo wau bibiyahu u ma pilopowali Lio ma'o, lapatio ma'o timongolio lotombiilu lo landobi mongolio: \"Utie botiie haku lo Allah, wau utia mai haku lo bu'i-bu'iyaala lami, yio toonulola u pilopodu-lungi mongolio to bu'i-bu'iyaala limongolio diila tilunggulo ode Allah, boo toonulola u pilopodulungi mongolio to Allah yio tilunggulo ode bu'i-bu'iyaala limongolio. Moleeta tutu bubuto'i mongolio boito."}]},{"id":926,"verse_number":137,"verse_key":"6:137","hizb_number":15,"rub_el_hizb_number":58,"ruku_number":117,"manzil_number":2,"sajdah_number":null,"chapter_id":6,"page_number":145,"juz_number":8,"words":[{"id":78738,"position":1,"audio_url":"wbw/006_137_001.mp3","char_type_name":"word","line_number":12,"location":"6:137:1","code_v1":"ﮱ","code_v2":"ﲬ","text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","text_indopak":"وَكَذٰلِكَ","page_number":145,"text":"ﲬ","translation":{"text":"And likewise","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wakadhālika","language_name":"english"}},{"id":78739,"position":2,"audio_url":"wbw/006_137_002.mp3","char_type_name":"word","line_number":13,"location":"6:137:2","code_v1":"ﯓ","code_v2":"ﲭ","text_uthmani":"زَيَّنَ","text_indopak":"زَيَّنَ","page_number":145,"text":"ﲭ","translation":{"text":"made pleasing","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"zayyana","language_name":"english"}},{"id":78740,"position":3,"audio_url":"wbw/006_137_003.mp3","char_type_name":"word","line_number":13,"location":"6:137:3","code_v1":"ﯔ","code_v2":"ﲮ","text_uthmani":"لِكَثِيرٍۢ"